    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.7-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "মনে করি, $m, n$ উভয়ে ধনাত্মক এবং $\\overrightarrow{AB} = m<u>u</u> \\quad \\therefore |\\overrightarrow{AB}| = m|<u>u</u>|$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
