    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c12-t12.7-p009",
      "kind": "formula",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$|\\overrightarrow{AC}| = |\\overrightarrow{AB}| + |\\overrightarrow{BC}| = m|<u>u</u>| + n|<u>u</u>| = (m + n)|<u>u</u>| \\quad \\therefore \\overrightarrow{AC} = (m + n)<u>u</u>$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
