      "body": "কিন্তু $\\overrightarrow{AC} = \\overrightarrow{AB} + \\overrightarrow{BC} \\quad \\therefore m<u>u</u> + n<u>u</u> = (m + n)<u>u</u>$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
